### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### 1. Register a Doctor User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "dr_smith",
  "email": "dr.smith@hospital.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "roles": [
    "DOCTOR"
  ]
}

### 2. Register a Receptionist User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "receptionist_mary",
  "email": "mary.reception@hospital.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "roles": [
    "RECEPTIONIST"
  ]
}

### 3. Register an Admin User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin_hms",
  "email": "admin@hospital.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "roles": [
    "ADMIN"
  ]
}

### 4. Login (Retrieve JWT Token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "dr_smith",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### 5. Get User by ID
# Replace {{userId}} with the UUID returned from register/login response
@userId = 2df14a60-5703-4c90-a61b-e6f9c99b514a
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 6. Register with Case-Insensitive Role (e.g. "Admin") - Expects 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin_case_test",
  "email": "case.admin@hospital.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "roles": [
    "Admin"
  ]
}

### 7. Register with Invalid / Random Role - Expects 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "bad_role_user",
  "email": "bad.role@hospital.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "roles": [
    "random_role"
  ]
}

